            {
                "entry_id": "445c9e5d-3769-334b-9eb9-bfe973455af9",
                "word": "hunky",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6081ea66-565e-426b-b58c-77080aba3128",
                        "entry_id": "445c9e5d-3769-334b-9eb9-bfe973455af9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hunkies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                        "entry_id": "445c9e5d-3769-334b-9eb9-bfe973455af9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Hungarian or other eastern European, e.g. a Romanian or a Slav. (Sometimes applied (like honky) to any white person.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "ethnic",
                            "slang",
                            "slur",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61fbc8e3-aa48-4e22-9cf6-028bcd99f70e",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "\"All hunkies and wops, and no wonder there was seven hundred and fifty of them.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac260f8f-1987-47ce-aa95-f08b88192662",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "He made hunkies and cut ice-cream sandwiches."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f1df7d6-0796-45ab-93cf-cf17466a98a4",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "The night before I had let a hunky called Big John have a dollar's worth of chips in the poker game […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dff5b795-e9e8-4e28-bb2e-42dc3bfef4fc",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "He said, \"I'm going to buy this building and turn this into a Nigger bar. I'm going to bar all you fucking hunkies.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "008bbc82-a678-4c58-b174-b7827d0f0cc5",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "On the negative side, a hunky was culturally schizophrenic, an inhabitant of crowded and ill-kept rooms and whose clothing was in poor taste, an alcoholic, intrinsically dull and stupid, an offspring of domineering parents, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35097884-319f-4c17-bd71-25e6ec6e7c8e",
                                "sense_id": "3c5ca1cf-a36b-35b5-ba49-c51e52e975d3",
                                "text": "Like blacks, who were the only ethnic group below them on the social scale, Eastern Europeans, contemptuously labelled ‘hunkies’, were dismissed as incapable and untrustworthy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
